&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Justification du tag SUP :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HIGHLY recommend a stronger resin for these (I used ABS-like) as those are some tiny bones. Supports can be tricky, so I&amp;rsquo;m not even going to attempt to upload pre-supported as all machines are different and you&amp;rsquo;ll have to probably deal with some failures before they come out perfect. I found a slight angle on 2 axes worked best for me.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>[GRATUIT] Thingiverse &gt; Morticai99 &gt; Titanicus_Terminals [non dl]</title><link>https://loboto51.github.io/bibmod3d/p/gratuit-thingiverse-morticai99-titanicus_terminals-non-dl/</link><pubDate>Fri, 14 Mar 2025 13:18:45 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://loboto51.github.io/bibmod3d/p/gratuit-thingiverse-morticai99-titanicus_terminals-non-dl/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://loboto51.github.io/bibmod3d/p/gratuit-thingiverse-morticai99-titanicus_terminals-non-dl/thumbs_-_6978781_-_Images_1.jpg" alt="Featured image of post [GRATUIT] Thingiverse &gt; Morticai99 &gt; Titanicus_Terminals [non dl]" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://loboto51.github.io/bibmod3d/p/gratuit-thingiverse-morticai99-titanicus_terminals-non-dl/thumbs_-_6978781_-_Images_1.jpg"
